The aliens are too soft.

00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:55.220
If you want to win, the key is to act fast.

00:11:59.770 --> 00:12:03.470
"This is what she did the minute 
I gave her the sealing device.

00:12:03.470 --> 00:12:06.880
Humans really are aggressive."

00:12:07.210 --> 00:12:13.040
But Generalissimo, Benika is 
actually a very kind, scared girl.

00:12:13.440 --> 00:12:15.770
That's why I...

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:19.210
Come on, Nebula Soldier.

00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:23.340
You shouldn't have had time to 
recover from the last battle.

00:12:24.020 --> 00:12:26.050
Sorry, but I'm taking you down now.

00:12:27.820 --> 00:12:29.730
K-Kuroi-kun?

00:12:29.730 --> 00:12:31.230
I thought it was over...

00:12:32.040 --> 00:12:35.060
It's so sudden. It must be Takatori-san.

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:37.430
I guess that's what I should've expected.

00:12:37.430 --> 00:12:38.980
Kuroi-kun, you should hurry.

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:40.940
I'm not fighting.

00:12:42.290 --> 00:12:43.150
Kuroi-kun?

00:12:43.710 --> 00:12:47.300
You're out there watching somewhere,
 right, Ginko? Sensei?

00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:49.010
I'm not going to fight!

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:51.790
Well, that's a problem, Sensei.

00:12:52.130 --> 00:12:54.580
I even gave you a declaration of war.

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:56.250
Are you sure you can't find 
it in your heart to fight?

00:12:56.940 --> 00:13:02.280
The Generalissimo doesn't 
want to win without fighting.

00:13:02.280 --> 00:13:03.610
I said no, and I meant it.

00:13:03.610 --> 00:13:05.530
Don't be so childish.

00:13:05.530 --> 00:13:06.550
I am a child.

00:13:06.950 --> 00:13:09.560
You're willing to let the Earth be sealed?

00:13:09.770 --> 00:13:12.060
She's an Earthling, too!

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:15.880
Why were you protecting the Earth until now?

00:13:15.880 --> 00:13:19.270
Wasn't it for her, and for the 
rest of the people in this town?

00:13:22.190 --> 00:13:23.280
Come on...

00:13:23.750 --> 00:13:28.240
It feels like she's more interested 
in convincing Soya-kun than we are.

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:31.130
You guys say something, too!

00:13:31.130 --> 00:13:33.580
What will you do, Soya-kun?

00:13:35.390 --> 00:13:39.930
I defeated the one who had 
the power of the dragon.

00:13:40.440 --> 00:13:44.170
So my battle, my revenge, is over.

00:13:44.930 --> 00:13:46.590
I'm satisfied.

00:13:49.130 --> 00:13:50.510
I'm tired of all this.

00:13:54.360 --> 00:13:55.490
Kuroi-kun?

00:13:55.490 --> 00:13:56.640
I'm tired of it.

00:13:57.010 --> 00:13:59.400
But your personal problems aren't...

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:01.070
It is personal!

00:14:02.240 --> 00:14:03.510
Kuroi-kun!

00:14:04.240 --> 00:14:06.060
I don't care about the Earth.

00:14:06.480 --> 00:14:08.780
My planet is gone, anyway.

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:11.530
My town is gone.

00:14:12.270 --> 00:14:13.870
My brother is gone!

00:14:14.060 --> 00:14:16.120
My mom and my dad and my grandma, too!

00:14:16.480 --> 00:14:18.250
I never got a chance to 
make up with Katorne,

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:19.890
and Belkel moved far away,

00:14:19.890 --> 00:14:21.630
and I never gave Tairan back his book.

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:23.560
The park where I played every day,

00:14:23.560 --> 00:14:24.970
my favorite bakery,

00:14:24.970 --> 00:14:26.720
the lake where my grandpa fished...

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:28.050
They're all gone!

00:14:29.210 --> 00:14:32.510
It's all gone now.

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:34.450
They're gone now!

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:35.980
All of them!

00:14:36.320 --> 00:14:38.350
They're gone!

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:47.020
They're all gone!

00:14:53.270 --> 00:14:55.180
What's wrong, Nebula Soldier?

00:14:55.920 --> 00:14:57.300
You're not coming?

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:00.080
Leave, please!

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:01.540
You...

00:15:01.800 --> 00:15:04.780
Kuroi-kun protected our town.

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:08.010
Maybe he didn't mean to do it, but he did!

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:11.470
So this time, it's my turn to protect him!

00:15:12.110 --> 00:15:13.430
Nozo-san...

00:15:13.950 --> 00:15:15.140
That girl...

00:15:15.960 --> 00:15:17.040
Protect him?

00:15:17.040 --> 00:15:18.100
How?

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:20.810
F-For now, we're going to run!

00:15:21.260 --> 00:15:22.540
Let's go, Kuroi-kun!

00:15:22.540 --> 00:15:23.240
Um...

00:15:23.240 --> 00:15:24.940
You don't have to fight anymore.

00:15:27.510 --> 00:15:30.210
It hurt, didn't it? I'm sorry.

00:15:32.090 --> 00:15:33.490
Thank you.

00:15:36.520 --> 00:15:38.930
Yeah, she's a good kid.

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:42.120
I'm glad.

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:44.010
There's no point in running.

00:15:45.020 --> 00:15:47.900
Hey, what are you doing out here?

00:15:47.900 --> 00:15:48.950
You need to escape.

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:51.590
Oh, Torai-san!

00:15:51.990 --> 00:15:55.090
Shiraishi-san? Why the hell 
are you wearing that?

00:15:59.710 --> 00:16:02.130
Are they... the Nebula Soldiers?

00:16:02.130 --> 00:16:03.110
Yup.

00:16:03.110 --> 00:16:04.730
Nice to see you again.

00:16:05.670 --> 00:16:07.510
What are you still doing here?

00:16:07.510 --> 00:16:10.350
The Sealing Faction's
 Nebula Weapon is on its way!

00:16:10.350 --> 00:16:11.490
Aren't you going to fight?

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:13.000
Well, you see...

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:15.140
Kuroi-kun's not going to fight anymore!

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:18.490
Who are you?

00:16:20.260 --> 00:16:21.580
What's wrong?

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:23.120
You look pathetic.

00:16:23.650 --> 00:16:25.080
Why aren't you going to fight?

00:16:25.410 --> 00:16:26.840
Have you given up on your revenge?

00:16:29.410 --> 00:16:30.480
It doesn't matter anymore.

00:16:31.330 --> 00:16:32.520
I don't want to fight.

00:16:36.370 --> 00:16:37.490
Hey!

00:16:39.980 --> 00:16:40.870
Okay.

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:42.480
Well said.

00:16:43.010 --> 00:16:43.690
I'll do it instead!

00:16:48.040 --> 00:16:49.530
That's...

00:16:49.730 --> 00:16:52.360
For now, just get out of here! Hurry!

00:16:52.620 --> 00:16:54.390
T-Torai-san?

00:16:55.170 --> 00:16:58.120
The huge unknown object is 
maintaining speed as it approaches!

00:16:58.650 --> 00:17:00.820
Are the warriors of light not here yet?

00:17:01.990 --> 00:17:04.730
I guess if you're not coming, that's fine.

00:17:05.670 --> 00:17:06.960
I'll seal you all.

00:17:07.550 --> 00:17:10.890
Farewell, town I failed to protect.

00:17:16.210 --> 00:17:17.410
Can I do this?

00:17:21.170 --> 00:17:22.630
The vial was just the key.

00:17:24.320 --> 00:17:26.810
I am the source of my own power!

00:17:28.450 --> 00:17:30.800
Psychokinetic Mega-God Photon Armor!

00:17:40.900 --> 00:17:41.850
I did it!

00:17:41.850 --> 00:17:44.830
I can still use my power!

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:49.300
The Nebula Soldier?

00:17:49.300 --> 00:17:50.750
No... Torai-san?

00:17:52.580 --> 00:17:53.880
Takatori!

00:17:54.060 --> 00:17:55.010
Torai-san!

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:04.330
I never thought it would be 
you that came, Torai-san!

00:18:04.330 --> 00:18:06.360
You didn't want me to stop you?

00:18:06.360 --> 00:18:07.770
You're the one who gave me the hint I needed!

00:18:07.770 --> 00:18:08.750
What hint?

00:18:08.750 --> 00:18:10.980
You told me the vials were just the key!

00:18:11.150 --> 00:18:12.200
That was...

00:18:13.270 --> 00:18:14.840
Maybe you're right!

00:18:14.840 --> 00:18:15.360
But...

00:18:18.260 --> 00:18:21.370
You shouldn't try and figure out 
how a young maiden really feels!

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:22.990
You really think you're a young maiden?

00:18:22.990 --> 00:18:24.500
I sure do!

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:32.470
That Photon Armor...

00:18:32.470 --> 00:18:34.510
Is that Torai-san and Takatori-san?

00:18:34.720 --> 00:18:37.470
What's going on?

00:18:40.820 --> 00:18:43.920
Kuroi-kun, the evacuation zone is over there.

00:18:43.920 --> 00:18:46.240
No, I'm going to watch from here.

00:18:46.240 --> 00:18:47.370
I see.

00:18:48.550 --> 00:18:51.300
"Soya, don't let it bug you so much."

00:18:51.300 --> 00:18:55.070
"We haven't recovered enough 
to even put up a real fight."

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:57.240
That's what Sensei says.

00:18:57.820 --> 00:18:59.820
I'm not letting it bug me.

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:03.450
Let the Earthlings figure out 
what happens to their planet.

00:19:03.650 --> 00:19:07.580
Well, that's exactly what we Pacifists think.

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:08.660
Then what's wrong?

00:19:09.100 --> 00:19:13.630
The existence of the sealing devices 
isn't the Earthlings' responsibility.

00:19:16.360 --> 00:19:17.340
What's wrong?

00:19:23.030 --> 00:19:23.970
Hey...

00:19:24.290 --> 00:19:26.160
You again?

00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:28.310
What were you again? The People of Paradise?

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:30.880
Who?

00:19:30.240 --> 00:19:32.170
What are you doing here, now?

00:19:30.880 --> 00:19:32.170
Where!? Where?!

00:19:32.170 --> 00:19:34.670
I thought you'd have some free time.

00:19:35.010 --> 00:19:36.230
Well, you're right, I guess.

00:19:36.800 --> 00:19:39.340
But you're the face I least 
want to see right now.

00:19:39.340 --> 00:19:40.200
Get lost.

00:19:40.440 --> 00:19:41.550
I see.

00:19:41.550 --> 00:19:44.970
I think I'm wearing the face 
of someone you'd want to see.

00:19:45.400 --> 00:19:46.120
Stop it.

00:19:48.280 --> 00:19:49.130
Oh, my!

00:19:53.530 --> 00:19:54.070
What?

00:19:54.070 --> 00:19:56.540
What was that, Soya-kun?

00:19:56.540 --> 00:19:57.510
No, um...

00:19:57.510 --> 00:20:00.580
When you get mad, you lose
 control of your psychic powers.

00:20:01.390 --> 00:20:04.980
Soya-kun, are the People 
of Paradise really here?

00:20:04.980 --> 00:20:06.840
What, you've heard of them?

00:20:07.730 --> 00:20:09.220
"They're the oldest sentient 
race in the universe."

00:20:09.220 --> 00:20:13.110
"They surpassed the need for physical bodies 
and evolved into higher dimensions."

00:20:13.110 --> 00:20:15.270
That's what Sensei says.

00:20:15.570 --> 00:20:20.240
They're a legendary race that some say were 
even involved in the creation of Nebula.

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:23.950
And what would guys like that 
want with someone like me?

00:20:29.990 --> 00:20:30.790
He's strong!

00:20:31.740 --> 00:20:33.050
Oh, dear.

00:20:33.050 --> 00:20:34.500
This is...

00:20:36.880 --> 00:20:38.000
<i>I knew it...</i>

00:20:38.520 --> 00:20:41.000
<i>Benika can't beat Torai-san.</i>

00:20:41.650 --> 00:20:45.810
<i>Torai-san is such a great guy.
He's like the man Benika loved.</i>

00:20:46.870 --> 00:20:48.810
<i>Like my older brother...</i>

00:20:52.730 --> 00:20:53.940
Torai-san!

00:20:54.480 --> 00:20:59.020
You really do make a better good guy.

00:20:59.240 --> 00:21:03.360
You don't make a good traitor 
to humanity, either.

00:21:04.070 --> 00:21:06.080
If you'd used your full 
power without hesitation,

00:21:06.430 --> 00:21:08.780
this would've been a harder fight to win.

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:28.260
Benika!

00:21:31.260 --> 00:21:32.140
Benika!

00:21:34.070 --> 00:21:35.330
Benika!

00:21:42.390 --> 00:21:44.950
What I wanted to talk to 
you about was the dragon.

00:21:45.830 --> 00:21:48.780
Nebula banished the dragon, 
but he didn't die.

00:21:49.350 --> 00:21:50.910
He's still alive.

00:21:52.720 --> 00:21:55.490
He's asleep on the dark side of the moon.

00:21:55.490 --> 00:21:56.580
Eventually he'll wake up.

00:21:57.230 --> 00:22:01.650
And when he does, Soya-kun, 
I want you to defeat him.

00:22:04.350 --> 00:22:06.330
It's too late for any of this.

00:22:06.970 --> 00:22:09.970
<b><i>To Be Continued</i></b>

00:23:39.980 --> 00:23:45.090
<b><i>Next Time
Messenger of Awakening</i></b>

00:23:43.590 --> 00:23:45.090
"Messenger of Awakening."
